<section class="bg-white dark:bg-slate-900 py-16">
  <div class="max-w-3xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8">
    <h1 class="text-4xl font-bold text-slate-900 dark:text-white mb-6 text-center">DMCA / Copyright Takedown</h1>

    <div class="prose dark:prose-invert max-w-none">
      <p class="text-slate-600 dark:text-slate-400">
        <%= siteTitle %> respects the intellectual property rights of others. We do not host or index videos; our tool processes user-submitted URLs using publicly available extractor libraries.
      </p>

      <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-slate-900 dark:text-white mt-8 mb-4">Reporting Infringement</h2>
      <p class="text-slate-600 dark:text-slate-400">If you believe content downloaded through our service infringes your copyright, please contact us with the following details:</p>
      <ul class="list-disc pl-6 space-y-2 text-slate-600 dark:text-slate-400">
        <li>Your full name and contact information.</li>
        <li>A description of the copyrighted work you believe has been infringed.</li>
        <li>The URL(s) of the allegedly infringing content.</li>
        <li>A good-faith statement that the use is not authorized by the copyright owner.</li>
        <li>A statement under penalty of perjury that the information is accurate.</li>
      </ul>

      <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-slate-900 dark:text-white mt-8 mb-4">Our Response</h2>
      <p class="text-slate-600 dark:text-slate-400">We will review valid notices promptly and take appropriate action, which may include blocking access to specific URLs or disabling features that are primarily used for infringement.</p>

      <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-slate-900 dark:text-white mt-8 mb-4">Contact</h2>
      <p class="text-slate-600 dark:text-slate-400">Submit your notice through our <a href="/contact" class="text-sky-600 dark:text-sky-400 hover:underline">Contact</a> page, selecting “Copyright / DMCA” as the subject.</p>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
